      "content": "It is exhausting to carry such immense pressure, and the desire for the struggle to simply cease is a very understandable response to overwhelming pain. Please know that you do not have to pretend to be okay for anyone. If the weight feels too heavy to bear, reaching out to a professional counselor or therapist can offer a safe space to process these deep feelings without judgment. They can help you navigate this void in a structured and supportive way.",
      "source": "target",
